<div id="block-phsc-athletics-mainpagecontent" class="block-phsc-athletics-mainpagecontent block block--main-page-content">
  
    
      <div class="block__content">
      <article id="node-1" >

  
    

  
    <div class="view-mode-full">
    <div class="field-wrapper field field-node--field-dept-body field-name-field-dept-body field-type-text-long field-label-hidden">
    <div class="field-items">
          <div class="field-item"><p>The athletics program at PHSC is an integral part of the overall mission of the institution. We are&nbsp; proud of our team's accomplishments and of our student athletes, both on and off the field. PHSC's athletics program promotes continued student growth through the acquisition of knowledge, physical development, social skills and values through opportunities to participate in intercollegiate athletic activities. &nbsp;</p>

<p>PHSC’s teams are frequent contenders in championship tournaments. The college is a member of the National Junior College Athletic Association (NJCAA) and the Florida College System Activities Association (FCSAA).</p>
</div>
      </div>
</div>

  </div>

  
  
  
</article>

